<title>CHINA: Marine Containers gets $25 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Marine Containers gets $25 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China International Marine Containers Co ltd has obtained a $25 million loan from Japan's Sumitomo Bank, the China Securities said on Monday.</p>
<p>The loan agreement was signed in Shenzhen, where Marine Containers is based, the newspaper said. The funds would be used to finance the company's production of containers for railway transports.</p>
<p>The company plans to provide 25,000 standard containers to China's railways in the future, it said, but gave no further details.</p>
</text>
